  "description": "Painted Desert Fur Con is an annual furry convention in the Phoenix, Arizona, area, organized by Anthropomorphic Events Incorporated, a 501(c)(3) non-profit. The first was held February 1 to 3, 2019, at the Scottsdale Plaza Resort in Paradise Valley with 1,135 attendees, and since the 2021 edition it has been held over New Year's at the Sheraton Phoenix Downtown, growing to 2,064 attendees in 2026. Each year has a theme, and its charities have included Retired Paws, the Phoenix Herpetological Sanctuary and Crystal's Critter Haven.",
